COMPND   2 MOLECULE: GLUTAMATE RECEPTOR 2,;                                     
COMPND   3 CHAIN: A, B;                                                         
COMPND   4 SYNONYM: GLUR-2,AMPA-SELECTIVE GLUTAMATE RECEPTOR 2,GLUR-B,GLUR-K2,  
COMPND   5 GLUTAMATE RECEPTOR IONOTROPIC,AMPA 2,GLUA2,GLUR-2,AMPA-SELECTIVE     
